# semgrep reads this file instead of its built-in ignore list, which drops
# *_test.go and test/ directories. Without this file a full scan (`.`) skipped
# every test while a staged scan (explicit file paths) included them, so the
# same rules gave different results by mode (X2-006).
#
# Decision: tests are in scope. Rules that must not apply to tests exclude
# them per rule with `paths.exclude` in .semgrep.yml.
:include .gitignore

.git/
.skillshare/
.claude/
.staticanalysis/
docs/
vendor/
dist/
bin/
